<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns &quot;AA-&quot; on Portugal's dual ccy samurai.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns &quot;AA-&quot; on Portugal's dual ccy samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's (S&amp;P) said on Thursday it had assigned its &quot;AA-&quot; rating to Portugal's upcoming yen/U.S. dollar dual-currency Samurai bond issue.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating was stable, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
